  "body": "When looking at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#updating-the-image-data, the value of `selected pixel density` only gets assigned to the current request's current pixel density if the image is in the \"list of available images\".\r\n\r\nSeems like the value should also be assigned when the image is fetched from the network.\r\n\r\n/cc @zcorpan  ",
